==== hyperbricks yaml {!{images}} ====
images:
  - type: images
  - directory: hyperbricks-yaml-test-files/assets/
  - id: '#img_'
  - loading: lazy
  - quality: "1"
  - width: "100"
==== explainer ====
JPEG quality from 1 to 100; omit or use 0 for 90. Does not affect PNG or GIF encoding.
==== expected json ====
{
  "Alt": "",
  "Class": "",
  "ConfigCategory": "",
  "ConfigType": "<IMAGES>",
  "Directory": "hyperbricks-yaml-test-files/assets/",
  "Enclose": "",
  "ExtraAttributes": null,
  "Height": 0,
  "HyperBricksFile": "",
  "HyperBricksKey": "",
  "HyperBricksPath": "",
  "Id": "#img_",
  "IsStatic": false,
  "Loading": "lazy",
  "MetaDocDescription": "",
  "Quality": 1,
  "Title": "",
  "Width": 100
}

==== expected output ====
<img src="/static/images/cute_cat_26667dba472087c1fad0d3e4ef8696b3_w100_h100.jpg" width="100" height="100" alt="" id="#img_0" loading="lazy" />
<img src="/static/images/same_cute_cat_26667dba472087c1fad0d3e4ef8696b3_w100_h100.jpg" width="100" height="100" alt="" id="#img_1" loading="lazy" />
